  </steps>
  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Tests fail on origin/master: a Procedure, a Signal-less billing and an assign-firm Decision Record the caller can read appear under their core record with no Open action.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: a non-member of a secure family sees none of them; a record that is Signal-backed is listed once; a test proves each new read is bounded (cap + truncation flag) and runs as the caller.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Contract baseline updated in the same PR; existing Signal-backed and gate listings unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, Signals filter, full ArchTests, client checks if the client changes; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
